{
  "name": "inwendo ERP: warning on access outside a booking",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Access outside a booking\nEvery successful door opening (smart lock log) is checked against the occupancy of the room: no booking, lead or lag time running → warning.\n\nNeeds the ERP setting integration_occupancy_api_enabled (and integration_ha_access_events_enabled for the access summary). Set the bookable ID in \"Occupancy of the Room\".",
